/* Inset layout: the sidebar, tabs and footer sit on an outer layer around a
   rounded card holding the workspace. Its surfaces ignore the translucency
   settings. By default they are a neutral shell at 80% over the window blur
   with a faint wash, and the content panel the deepest plane in dark mode,
   white in light. A workspace
   theme swaps the colours through the `--wt-*` variables. */
